timestral_ft.compat adapts the pinned Timestral advancing-frame normalization
for a finite derivative at the standard-deviation floor, preserving its forward
values and float64 statistics. Original implementation: Mistral AI, scaler.py.

The optional GIFT-Eval integration executes the pinned Salesforce Timestral
evaluation notebook (Apache-2.0). The equivalent sliced seasonal-error helper is
based on GluonTS ev/ts_stats.py, Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates,
licensed under Apache License 2.0.

